      "content": "KINGS LANGLEY          \tLONDON ROAD TL 00 SE    \t\t\t\t\t(East side)                                      7/160                                   \tRed Lion PH - -                                       \tII Public house. C17 or earlier rear wing, front range c.1900. Exposed timber frame of rear wing brick infilled above brick cased ground floor. Red brick ground floor to front range with half timber and roughcast 1st floor. Old red tile roofs. Long single storey brick and slate rear range at NE. Listing NGR: TL0687004318"
